Use when your work produced files the user (or the system that started this task) should receive: documents, spreadsheets, slides, PDFs, images, audio or video, HTML or Markdown pages, archives. Call it once, after the files are final, listing every deliverable; the user gets a download and preview card for each one. Do not present intermediate scripts, scratch data or files you did not finish. Paths must be inside the project directory — save or copy a deliverable there first if it was written elsewhere. Presenting the same path again later records a new version.
